# Auto-requests security-owner review. Visibility only: require_code_owner_review
# is off because a sole owner cannot approve their own PR and would deadlock.
# Also what validate-waivers resolves `approved-by` against, so a waiver naming
# an unlisted approver fails the gate.
# The base-image Dockerfiles and the chart template are deliberately not owned:
# the gates guard those, and owning them would route every bump here.
/.circleci/          @MarkusReadius
/.github/            @MarkusReadius
/.trivyignore*       @MarkusReadius
# Catches a copy at the repo root, where the orb's default parameter points.
/trivy-secret.yaml   @MarkusReadius
# Posture scorecard: a security record.
/.security/          @MarkusReadius
# Shrinking SAST scope or un-ignoring a path must surface to the owner.
/.semgrepignore      @MarkusReadius
/.gitignore          @MarkusReadius
/SECURITY.md         @MarkusReadius
